# Supplementary Materials

## Associated Manuscript

Relaxations of Operational Models of Electricity and Water Systems with Variable-Speed Pumps

## Description

This repository contains the GAMS model files associated with the manuscript.

### Files

**SmallExample.gms**

Contains the illustrative example data described in the manuscript.

**CaseStudy.gms**

Contains the case-study model data used to generate the results reported in the manuscript.

## Authors

Weiying Gu
Ramteen Sioshansi

